Hi Andrew,

I've attached the decision from this afternoon's review with Anjali (BRT-MT-20240409-001). We counted 18 repeats in the 46 March deliveries. The single received tick on the 8 April sheet doesn't tell us who picked up the Fare Payments alert or the receipt query. Anjali has asked us to keep the reminders running while we sort out what gets recorded at handover.

Could you read the decision against tomorrow evening's handover before we try it? For each open item, see whether you can name the person taking it and say when the next check is due. Please flag any row where you can't identify the next owner. Leave its acknowledgement outstanding until someone accepts it by name. The previous shift's tick is no basis for carrying their name forward.

Thanks,
Daniel

